  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Equivalent to a question mark. Used mostly in informal male speech. Grammatical only for questions that can be answered \"yes/no\" (see also \"dai\"). Unsuitable to ask a superior a question. To the cab driver: \"Kita Senju made itte kureru kai?\" Will you go as far as Kita Senju for me?",
